; A quoted automated-transaction name ending in a lone backslash is an
; error; the scanner must not read past the end of the line.

= 'abc\
    Savings    10%
    Assets

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 4:
Error: Unexpected '\' at end of pattern
end test
